128 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 17 0 R
/E (  Evaluation metrics: accuracy, F1-score, precision, recall. Experimental results reveal distinct impacts of training strategies on model performance \(Table 1\). MobileNetV2 showed strong generalization with augmentation \(accuracy: 0.8399, F1-score: 0.8246\), balancing precision and recall. ResNet50 gained the most from augmentation \(F1: 0.7560\), benefiting from data variation. DenseNet121 performed best without augmentation \(accuracy: 0.8989, F1: 0.8966\), suggesting its architecture captures sufficient features and may be sensitive to further transformations.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [110]
>>
endobj
129 0 obj
