/Pg 9 0 R
/K [111]
>>
endobj
130 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 17 0 R
/E (In conclusion, classical augmentation remains a reliable strategy for improving model performance on small, non-standardized datasets, particularly when using MobileNetV2 or ResNet50. However, DenseNet121, even without augmentation, yields the best results, making it a strong candidate for houseplant disease classification under constrained data conditions.)
/Pg 9 0 R
/K [112]
>>
endobj
